<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-1994] .Net: CrossPlatformExample looks unnecessary</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-1994</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;At this moment there isn&apos;t Java and/or cpp CrossPlatform examples in the project. So .Net CrossPlatformExample looks unnecessary&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;More over there isn&apos;t config &apos;bin\ignite.bat examples\config\example-server.xml&apos; in project so this example will fails when user try to run it with remote node&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;


&lt;p&gt;Proposal: delete example from project or, at least, update example&apos;s description&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment>&lt;p&gt;Win7, Apache Ignite 1.5.0 build #82&lt;/p&gt;</environment>
